  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARAF Peanut Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cereals (Millet), Beneficiaries: 300 (150 women), Description: The project will provide a revolving fund to ensure timely access to improved seeds and fertilizers, training in best production practices, and animateurs to provide on the ground support and verify that farmers follow best practices to increase total area under production, increase yields, and increase incomes to farmers and the cooperative.,</narrative>
  </description>
